        { "left": "chinna", "right": "small" }
      ],
      "explanation": "These words are useful when shopping at a Telugu market."
    },
    {
      "id": "te-s3-l12-ex05",
      "type": "fill_in_blank",
      "sentence": "Pedda means big, ___ means small.",
      "correct": "chinna",
